[package_kubevirt_image.sh]
 - Used for pull the customized kubevirt docker image and package them to tar.gz file, then push to internal website.
 - Need to specify the kubevirt vhost version, and it will be uploaded interlnal artifactory, so need the user name and token for upload.
 - example: KUBEVIRT_VHOST_VERSION="V12" ./package_kubevirt_image.sh [user name] [credential]
